# Subject line: imperative mood, 50 chars or less
# Example: Add spike template to issue tracker

# Body (optional): wrap at 72 chars. Explain WHY, not what.
# What the diff shows is already visible; what the diff doesn't show
# (the constraint, the rejected alternative, the non-obvious invariant)
# is what belongs here.

# Leave one blank line between subject and body.
# Reference issues with: Closes #123 or Relates to #123
